Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, our pitcher yesterday was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:41.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it. \NThey should've just put me in like I—{they're probably talking about gym class or something}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:44.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We've got an idiot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:46.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Chill out. Relax, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:52.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But doesn't he seem thinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:55.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hope he's getting enough to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:57.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why not adopt him if you're so worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:01:59.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:02.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll start to get attached if I take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's so wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The more things you view as precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:15.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,the more they weigh you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's what he said the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:26.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then the scouts would come and I'd be off to Barcelona. {I don't get it}{I don't either}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:29.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He looks like he's enjoying himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:34.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but does he really think nothing of school or his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun really said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:43.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think he spends most of his nights wandering around
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and being with people he can't tell us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:51.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, you sure know a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:55.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I happened to see him and decided to play detective for a while.{I think in this case the literal translation ends up flowerier than the not}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,D-Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:00.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's messing around and neglecting his studies...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:04.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he even passed his midterms.{I don't think she knows yet?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're right to worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just overheard Mabuchi and Tanaka-sensei talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:16.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's Tanaka-sensei's voice. {motto cuter}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:24.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Every one of your midterm grades was below average.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:29.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you don't pull yourself together, you'll seriously get held back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:33.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I'll just drop out if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:34.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Drop out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:40.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're definitely going to regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Will I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Calm down, I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think people who want to quit should just do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but not if I have to see Tanaka-sensei so sad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That damn brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even if he was only joking, \NI don't want to even imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:21.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,After Mabuchi-kun spent all that time with us at the leadership course,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:25.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,does he really still not think any of it is precious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Kou
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:38.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,must have his reasons for saying such depressing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:41.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:47.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So from here on out, let's do everything we can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,to make sure he can never say those things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think you've gotten prettier lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Though you were cute to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:01.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh, really? You're making me blush here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:04.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Actually, I decided to put on some makeup today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that. You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:15.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:20.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So today we will review some ancient Chinese history...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,"We'll have fun every time we hang out together."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That's what I want Kou to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,How can I get him to be one of us?
