Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:35.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Idiot. Your stupid note got me in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, it's my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:40.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the one who called him a bald peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well yeah, he's balding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fnRoyfont\b1\pos(266.285,568.286)}Still there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fnRoyfont\b1\pos(266.285,568.286)}Still there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,His baldness isn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fnRoyfont\b1\pos(266.285,568.286)}Still there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is your face different today? {intentionally blunt/tactless}{aduk sen luudein se sa?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I used a bit of makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\an2\fsp3\bord3\fs70\shad0\c&HCA9DE7&\3c&HEBE7F9&\fnKG First Time In Forever\b1\move(1465.857,578.000,-200.000,578.000)\alpha&H80&}For Kou's sake
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an2\fsp3\bord3\fs70\shad0\3c&HEBE7F9&\c&HEBE7F9&\fnKG First Time In Forever\b1\move(1465.857,578.000,-200.000,578.000)}For Kou's sake
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an2\fsp3\bord0\fs70\shad0\c&HCA9DE7&\fnKG First Time In Forever\b1\move(1465.857,578.000,-200.000,578.000)}For Kou's sake
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:07:01.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason for a girl who usually goes natural to start using makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:09.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, you say something too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky, you're just Yoshioka. {orig: You're getting full of yourself, Yoshioka. Note that you MUST be able to use the latter part in their next exchange}{I was thinking something like "Like you're one to talk, Yoshioka" but ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And why are you talking like Doraemon? {I'm pretty sure this is the reference, and hopefully this way of doing it is alright}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When do you think Futaba-chan will be ready for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Might be a while, so let's just start without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:33.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's the CD Mabuchi-kun lent me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.14,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,You're just Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:34.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're just Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, I'm gonna go hit up the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't run away!{else it might sound like a "don't run in the hallways" thing}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tell it to my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:50.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No comment about the makeup, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:12.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,You're terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:22.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't come back if that's all you're gonna say!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:32.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, are you more of a croquette man or a yakisoba-roll man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:36.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? I guess if I had to pick, yakisoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:40.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Same here! There's just something about yakisoba on bread that gets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:43.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi, haven't seen you around lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Former classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:57.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're fitting in with the normal class now. It's like you've always been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must be in the advanced-track!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:04.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Kou,\N weren't you there too last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:08.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'd totally forgotten, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:13.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not like Mabuchi ever did well on our tests anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The normals suit you a lot more.{I was going to change this but it sound condescending enough so it's fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:19.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All last year I was asking myself why you were even in our class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:25.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I get it now. The only reason you made it was because you were related to Tanaka-sensei.{contractions don't obviate tense agreement}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No wonder you couldn't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your brother must be relieved you're where you belong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:36.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you'd actually failed out of the advanced track, he'd be out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We're just joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:52.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then your sense of humor sucks.{Then you have a shitty sense of humor.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:56.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Calm down. What are you so angry for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:02.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I get pissed off when someone trash talks my friend like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Damn those chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not so advanced if you—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:18.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Those guys tick me off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:22.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I hate people like that with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:41.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I should give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Those two are already...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:01.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:04.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Did he do something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:24.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is it true that he didn't do well on his midterms?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:28.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't exactly give out that information to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Were you concerned about him? {didn't want to use worried, and with him is different}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:42.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ever since he was a kid, Kou was one to hold it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:07.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He kept coming to me, crying "Nii-chan! Nii-chan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He relied on me without reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:15.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nii-chan, it really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, you're doing great.{this ganbaru is supposed to parallel the one a few lines down}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:32.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But he's got good friends who'll worry about him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:35.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be able to do his best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:37.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:42.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Head back to class now. \NLunch is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:46.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:00.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:05.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,About Mabuchi-kun and his grades...\NCan't we do anything to help him?
