Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:28.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:33.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you free this Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:55.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kou? Where you at right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:59.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato? I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Great, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.65,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,We're having a study party at your house today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.69,AoHaru alt,,0,0,80,,Should we get this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:04.65,AoHaru alt,,0,0,80,,Yeah, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.86,AoHaru alt,,0,0,80,,I really love this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:06.86,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,We'll be right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.78,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.29,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,What's he going on about...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:26.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, did he say a study party... here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did I dream it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:28.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:32.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Lock, lock, lock...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,G'morning, Mabuchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou's room is pretty big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it's well kept.{no hyphens for predicate adjectives (usually)}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:52.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you make sure to hide all your indecent books?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You didn't leave me enough time to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:15:01.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I brought the CD you lent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:10.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We'll be teaching you all of our best subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:12.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:17.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You heard her! We'll show those\N advanced-track pricks what's up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And apologize to Tanaka-sensei, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He was really worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get back up! {it was a fun time learning what this meant a few years back}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:35.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even studying can be fun if we all do it together.
