Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:40.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Look, I even brought chips!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's not taking the bait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:48.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun only just woke up, so we can't expect him to get right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:53.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I guess so. We'll go ahead and start then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, come over when you're more awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's good at math?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yo, I'm pretty solid at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:07.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then maybe you could explain this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:09.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me! Where's the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:14.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Crap, they're so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I need help with this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay, I see.{I have a strong preference for this one}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How do I start this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,For that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,you do this here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato-kun, stop it! You're getting crumbs all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They're all over our notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:04.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They're not consommé flavored. {what}{pls}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun got up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Those are only for people actually studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what she said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:18.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato, shove over. I need space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:24.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't push me, Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:28.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yay, Kou joined us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:32.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The snacks must've done it. \NLet's keep pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:35.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun, we have chocolate too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:37.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:40.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, what are you good at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I get that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then show me what you've got, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I know he's just making fun of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:59.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:03.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...so why does it feel so good? Am I a pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:07.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We can start with the problems from the midterm, okay?{I... think it's this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:09.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get to it or I'll fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:11.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um, Mabuchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:19.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Could you get everyone some cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:26.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll find some example questions in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:47.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Everything alright? Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:53.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They haven't been used in a while, so I decided to wash them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll dry them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:05.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:06.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mabuchi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you think of Futaba-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:24.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you li— {}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he does...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:32.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:37.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I couldn't hear you over the water. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:42.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he tells me that he likes Futaba-chan, what will I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:44.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:49.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:52.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll take these up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I kicked the bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll pick it right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:02.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you hurt your foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who the heck brought potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Those two sure are taking their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go check on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-sama, teach me English.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou? Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:09.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What happened? I thought you'd be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Also, where's Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did something happen with Kou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:50.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's not "nothing at all".
